---
interface Props { kind: 'agents' | 'map' | 'tasks'; }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['project-art',`art-${kind}`]} aria-hidden="true">
  {kind==='agents' && <div class="canvas-window"><div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots">● ● ●</span><span>harness / a place for your agents</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="canvas-layout"><div class="canvas-sidebar"><b>h.</b><span>◫</span><span>⌘</span><span>⊕</span><span>⚙</span></div><div class="canvas-body"><div class="canvas-heading"><span>My workspace <small>/ idea to outcome</small></span><span class="canvas-status">● Ready to build</span></div><div class="agent-flow"><div class="agent-root"><span>✳</span><div><small>YOUR TEAM</small><b>Coordinator</b></div><i>⋮</i></div><div class="branch-lines"></div><div class="agent-children"><div><span>⌕</span><b>Research</b><small>Find the context</small><i>● Connected</i></div><div><span>⌘</span><b>Build</b><small>Make it happen</small><i>● Connected</i></div><div><span>✓</span><b>Review</b><small>Keep it useful</small><i>● Connected</i></div></div></div><div class="canvas-prompt"><span>What would you like to build?</span><b>↑</b></div></div></div></div>}
  {kind==='map' && <><div class="map-backdrop"><div class="map-water"></div><div class="street street-a"></div><div class="street street-b"></div><div class="street street-c"></div><span class="park park-a"></span><span class="park park-b"></span><span class="city-label">SEOUL</span><span class="map-marker marker-a">✳</span><span class="map-marker marker-b">✳</span></div><div class="map-phone"><div class="phone-camera"></div><div class="phone-top"><span>9:41</span><span>▮▮▮</span></div><div class="phone-content"><small>GOOD FOOD, FOUND.</small><h4>A taste of<br />somewhere new.</h4><div class="search-pill">⌕ <span>Find a place in Seoul</span></div><div class="phone-map"><div></div><span>✳</span><span>✳</span><b>You are here</b></div><div class="place-preview"><span>🍜</span><div><b>Your next good meal</b><small>Explore nearby places ↗</small></div></div><div class="phone-tabs">⌂ <span>⌕</span> ♡</div></div></div><div class="map-caption hand">a little closer<br />to your next stop ↗</div></>}
  {kind==='tasks' && <div class="todo-window"><div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots">● ● ●</span><span>a little less to-do.</span><span>✳</span></div><div class="todo-layout"><div class="todo-sidebar"><b>Little things.</b><span class="todo-selected">☼ My day</span><span>☆ Important</span><span>▤ Everything</span><div class="todo-flower">✳</div></div><div class="todo-content"><small>ONE THING AT A TIME</small><h4>A little focus.<br /><span>A little progress.</span></h4><p>Make room for what matters.</p><div class="todo-row checked"><span>✓</span>Find the important thing</div><div class="todo-row checked"><span>✓</span>Break it into smaller steps</div><div class="todo-row"><span></span>Make something useful <i>today</i></div><div class="todo-add">+ Add a little thing</div><div class="todo-bottom"><span>2 of 3 things done</span><span>Nice work! ✦</span></div></div></div></div>}
</div>
